/target/
/docs/book/
__pycache__/
# Private maintainer artifacts. The capability ledger and the forbidden-term
# denylist both name a private downstream consumer, so they are untracked in
# this public repository. Scripts that need them fail closed when absent.
/private/
/migration/
/HERMES.md
*.pyc
*.profraw
*.profdata
.DS_Store
# Staging crates depend on the local Axiolid checkout by path, so their
# lockfile pins absolute paths from one machine. It is regenerated on build
# and must not be committed.
/staging/*/Cargo.lock
# Each staging crate roots its own workspace and so its own target dir.
/staging/*/target/

# The retired notice crate roots its own workspace, so it generates a lockfile
# and target dir beside its manifest. Neither belongs in the repo.
/attic/*/target/
/attic/*/Cargo.lock
